          "service: spare-six",
          "scope: beta-notes",
          "sensitivity: internal",
          "---",
          "",
          "## What it is",
          "The target of every write case that must leave the store UNCHANGED - a",
          "stale If-Match, an unprocessable body. Its revision therefore stays the",
          "revision of these bytes for the whole run.",
          "",
          "## Pointers",
          "- ops skill `manage-spare` - invoke it for restarts",
          "",
          "## Nuance / work-history",
          "- 2000-01-03: nothing has ever been written to this entry.",
          ""
        ],
        "uid": 0,
        "uname": ""
